# A1/A1.2/A1_21_town_and_opening_hours.letz
# Source: PDF slide deck "L12 a1convlotsmanmeli.pdf" (A1 Conversation course, Lesson 12)
# (m)/(f)/(n)/(pl) gender markers stripped; nouns re-cased to the definite article,
# gender confirmed via LOD lookup. Distractor tokens are sourced from other entries
# within this same lesson, or from common A1 vocabulary already taught earlier.
# Fills added: prepositions an/op/bei, opening-hours frames (vun...bis, um, op/zou),
# contracted prepositions (am/beim/um/mam/virum), and movement-vs-static article choice.
# Mined from deck exercises p.9–10 and opening-hours Q&A.

@lesson A1.21 "Town & Opening Hours"

# --- Town & places ---
@word d'Reklamm = the advertisement
@word d'Reklammen = the advertisements
@word d'Ëffnungszäiten = the opening hours
@word de Quartier = the quarter
@word d'Noperen = the neighbours
@word d'Mäert = the markets
@word d'Ruin = the ruin
@word d'Ruinen = the ruins
@word de Bistro = the pub, the café
@word d'Bistroen = the pubs, the cafés
@word de Panneau = the sign, the panel
@word d'Panneauen = the signs, the panels
@word d'Schëld = the sign
@word d'Schëlder = the signs
@word d'Geschicht = the story, the history
@word ongeféier = approximately
@word de Floss = the river
@word d'Fléss = the rivers
@word duerch = through

# --- Seasons & time ---
@word d'Fréijoer = the spring
@word den Hierscht = the autumn
@word de Wanter = the winter
@word d'Mëtt = the middle
@word d'Statu = the statue
@word d'Statuen = the statues

# --- Opening hours ---
@word zou = closed
@word samsdes = on Saturdays
@word nomëttes = in the afternoons

# --- Places & institutions ---
@word de Musée = the museum
@word de Bësch = the forest
@word d'Plage = the beach
@word d'Hochzäit = the wedding
@word de Concert = the concert
@word d'Ausstellung = the exhibition

# --- People & professions ---
@word de Professer = the professor
@word de Stagiaire = the intern
@word de Manager = the manager
@word d'Bomi = the grandma
@word d'Schlaang = the queue

# --- Verbs ---
@word daueren = to last

# --- Descriptive words & countries ---
@word Spuenien = Spain
@word Italien = Italy

@sentence
@lu Ech fanne mäi Kaffi op dem Dësch.
@en I find my coffee on the table.
@distractor-en window
@distractor-en cinema
