# --- @fill: prepositions an / op / bei ----------------------------------------
# The deck's core grammar: spatial an (closed places), op (open/institutional),
# bei (people/companies). Distractors are the other two — the three-way confusion.

@fill
@lu Ech schaffe [bei] dem Dokter Schmit.
@en I work [at] Doctor Schmit's.
@distractor-lu an
@distractor-lu op
@distractor-lu um
@distractor-en in
@distractor-en on
@distractor-en from

@fill
@lu Meng Kanner spillen haut [op] der Spillplaz.
@en My children play [at] the playground today.
@distractor-lu an
@distractor-lu bei
@distractor-lu um
@distractor-en in
@distractor-en near
@distractor-en from

@fill
